@startuml context
!include _theme.puml
' System boundary at 7190151; job feeds and application targets have different roles.
actor Candidate as Person
actor Administrator as Admin
rectangle "Public job-board\nAPIs" as Feeds
rectangle "<b>JobPilot</b>\nConsole, API and worker" as System
rectangle "Language-model\nprovider" as Model
rectangle "Live Greenhouse\nform" as Live
rectangle "Local fake ATS" as Fixture

Person -down-> System : résumé, answers\nand decisions
Admin -down-> System : worker and\nrecovery controls
Feeds -right-> System : listings
System -right-> Model : masked\nprompt
System -down-> Live : fill and hand off;\nno agent submit
System -down-> Fixture : approved submit;\ncheck confirmation
@enduml
